Package: protocol3Parser
Title: ProtoCOL3 Counts Export Parser
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Jack", "Pepper", , "jack.pepper@thekids.org.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Import and tidy ProtoCOL 3 colony counter and antibiotic zone
    reports exported as OpenDocument Spreadsheet (.ods) files. Functions are
    provided to parse plate-level metadata and count/zone data, extract
    structured components from plate names, split multi-value Flags into
    vectors, exclude plates matching a string, and combine results into
    analysis-ready data frames.
